# Room schemas (keep if you want to track migrations)
# composeApp/schemas/

# Secrets — never commit.
#
# This repository is PUBLIC, so anything committed here is permanent and
# world-readable even if deleted in a later commit. Signing keys and service
# account files are listed explicitly rather than relying on a glob.
.env
.env.*
*.env
local.properties
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist

# Signing material. A leaked upload key cannot be rotated without publishing a
# new app listing, so these must never reach a commit.
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
keystore.properties
signing.properties

# Build scans and crash dumps can embed absolute paths and environment values.
*.hprof
*.log
